      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782936529164,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "是 → 直接接收发送者数据\n无缓冲：从 sender sudog.elem 拷贝\n有缓冲且 buffer 满：取 buf[recvx]\n并把 sender 数据放入 buf[sendx/recvx]，唤醒 sender",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "8EdAr805vL_bSy2koioL0",
      "originalText": "是 → 直接接收发送者数据\n无缓冲：从 sender sudog.elem 拷贝\n有缓冲且 buffer 满：取 buf[recvx]\n并把 sender 数据放入 buf[sendx/recvx]，唤醒 sender",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0v",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
