      "seed": 1608092388,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 2009081700,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782936529189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "close 语义\n\nclose 不会清空 buffer\n关闭后仍可接收 buffer 中已有数据\nbuffer 读空后再接收返回 zero value, ok=false\n向 closed channel 发送一定 panic\n重复 close 一定 panic\nclose nil channel 一定 panic",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jVJsCVG3TdseuYQIQZjNR",
      "originalText": "close 语义\n\nclose 不会清空 buffer\n关闭后仍可接收 buffer 中已有数据\nbuffer 读空后再接收返回 zero value, ok=false\n向 closed channel 发送一定 panic\n重复 close 一定 panic\nclose nil channel 一定 panic",
