      "updated": 1782936529205,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "环形队列规则\n\nsendx 写入后递增，达到 dataqsiz 后回到 0\nrecvx 读取后递增，达到 dataqsiz 后回到 0\nqcount 表示当前 buffer 中元素数量\nbuffer 满：qcount == dataqsiz\nbuffer 空：qcount == 0",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "M49BPx0LuHmtNOK913NQ0",
      "originalText": "环形队列规则\n\nsendx 写入后递增，达到 dataqsiz 后回到 0\nrecvx 读取后递增，达到 dataqsiz 后回到 0\nqcount 表示当前 buffer 中元素数量\nbuffer 满：qcount == dataqsiz\nbuffer 空：qcount == 0",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2n",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "q7yfam_zUtrJTtPwszkyI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -340.344417458449,
      "y": 959.6005610648615,
      "width": 369.334228515625,
      "height": 127.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
